#. ja: 第二次基地拡張計画
#. de: Mondtor-Station: Erweiterung II
#. fr: Second agrandissement de la station
#. column 1: The Moongate Hub facilities are ready for expansion. Report to the construction site, remove any obstacles, and tend to any pending tasks.
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
msgctxt "Fate:2000:0:0"
msgid "Base Camp Beta Expansion"
msgstr "Расширение базы «Бета»"

#. ja: ムーンゲート基地の施設拡充のため<br>周辺の障害物を除去し、建築地点にて施工を行え
#. de: Die Mondtor-Station soll erweitert werden.<br>Entferne mögliche Hindernisse in der Umgebung und lege an den entsprechenden Stellen Hand an.
#. fr: Le chantier pour l'agrandissement de la station sélénienne se poursuit. Nettoyez les alentours des obstacles éventuels et participez aux travaux.
#. column 0: Base Camp Beta Expansion
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
msgctxt "Fate:2000:0:1"
msgid "The Moongate Hub facilities are ready for expansion. Report to the construction site, remove any obstacles, and tend to any pending tasks."
msgstr "На базе «Мунгейт» пора расширять помещения. Отправляйтесь на стройплощадку, уберите препятствия и выполните оставшиеся работы."

#. ja: 共同施工作業の進捗度を確認中<br>ギャザラー、クラフター以外では<br>報酬を受け取れないため注意せよ
#. de: Wollen wir doch mal sehen, wie es um deinen Beitragsgrad steht.<br>  Aber spitz die Löffel: Nur Handwerker und Sammler können vergütet werden.
#. fr: Estimation de la progression des travaux en cours. Attention, seuls les récolteurs et les artisans seront récompensés pour leur con<shy>tri<shy>bu<shy>tion.
#. column 0: Base Camp Beta Expansion
#. column 1: The Moongate Hub facilities are ready for expansion. Report to the construction site, remove any obstacles, and tend to any pending tasks.
#. column 3: Contribution
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Fate:2000:0:2"
msgid "Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards."
msgstr "Проверка вклада...<br>Награду получат только ремесленники и собиратели."

#. ja: 作業貢献度
#. de: Beitragsgrad
#. fr: Contribution
#. column 0: Base Camp Beta Expansion
#. column 1: The Moongate Hub facilities are ready for expansion. Report to the construction site, remove any obstacles, and tend to any pending tasks.
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
msgctxt "Fate:2000:0:3"
msgid "Contribution"
msgstr "Вклад"

#. ja: エネルギー設備拡充支援
#. de: Energisierungswerke: Erweiterung
#. fr: Expansion des infrastructures énergétiques
#. column 1: A phalanx of mini rovers facilitates energization expansions. Retrieve mini rover battery packs, charge them at charging modules, then return the replenished packs to ensure the machines continue their useful trundling.
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
msgctxt "Fate:2001:0:0"
msgid "Energization Expansion Support"
msgstr "Расширение энергостанции"

#. ja: ミニローダーのエネルギータンクを取り外し<br>エネルギースタンドにて充填して<br>ミニローダーにエネルギーを供給せよ
#. de: Für die Arbeiten an den Energisierungswerken wird Unterstützung benötigt.<br>Fülle die Energievorräte der Minimechas an den entsprechenden Stellen auf.
#. fr: Récupérez les réservoirs d'énergie puis rechargez-les pour fournir de l'énergie aux ouvriers cosmiques.
#. column 0: Energization Expansion Support
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
msgctxt "Fate:2001:0:1"
msgid "A phalanx of mini rovers facilitates energization expansions. Retrieve mini rover battery packs, charge them at charging modules, then return the replenished packs to ensure the machines continue their useful trundling."
msgstr "Мини-роверы помогают расширять энергостанцию. Снимите с них аккумуляторы, зарядите их на зарядных модулях и верните на место, чтобы машины могли дальше трудиться."

#. ja: 共同施工作業の進捗度を確認中<br>ギャザラー、クラフター以外では<br>報酬を受け取れないため注意せよ
#. de: Wollen wir doch mal sehen, wie es um deinen Beitragsgrad steht.<br>  Aber spitz die Löffel: Nur Handwerker und Sammler können vergütet werden.
#. fr: Estimation de la progression des travaux en cours. Attention, seuls les récolteurs et les artisans seront récompensés pour leur con<shy>tri<shy>bu<shy>tion.
