#. ja: 第一次リフト用地整備
#. de: Lift: Vorbereitungsarbeiten I
#. fr: Première préparation du site pour l'ascenseur
#. column 1: To prepare for construction of the nadir lift, excavate the proposed site, collect the resultant debris, then transport it to the disposal site.
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
msgctxt "Fate:2005:0:0"
msgid "Nadir Lift Site Preparation"
msgstr "Подготовка площадки нижнего лифта"

#. ja: リフト開通予定地点で掘削作業を行い<br>掘り出した月面掘削の土砂を回収して<br>集積場まで運搬せよ
#. de: Ein Lift will errichtet werden.<br>Sammle die abgetragene Erde auf und entlade sie am Abladeplatz.
#. fr: Le chantier d'excavation pour la mise en place d'un ascenseur a commencé. Forez la roche, récupérez les gravats lunaires et apportez-les jusqu'aux dépôts.
#. column 0: Nadir Lift Site Preparation
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
msgctxt "Fate:2005:0:1"
msgid "To prepare for construction of the nadir lift, excavate the proposed site, collect the resultant debris, then transport it to the disposal site."
msgstr "Подготовьте площадку для строительства нижнего лифта: раскопайте отведённое место, соберите грунт и отвезите его на свалку."

