#. ja: 第二次基地拡張計画
#. de: Glasbläser-Basis: Erweiterung II
#. fr: Second agrandissement de la station
#. column 1: Glassblowers' Beacon facilities are ready for expansion. Help lay the foundation and clean up glass dust from the surrounding area.
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
msgctxt "Fate:2033:0:0"
msgid "Beacon Camp Beta Expansion"
msgstr "Расширение базы «Маяк стеклодувов»: этап II"

#. ja: グラスブロワーズ基地の施設拡張のため<br>建築地点にて基礎工事と集塵を行い、施工を進行せよ
#. de: Die Glasbläser-Basis soll erweitert werden.<br>Hilf beim Grundbau mit, sammle den entstehenden Staub ein und lege an den entsprechenden Stellen Hand an.
#. fr: Le chantier pour l'agrandissement de la station Souffleverre a commencé. Préparez les fondations et participez aux travaux de déblayage.
#. column 0: Beacon Camp Beta Expansion
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
msgctxt "Fate:2033:0:1"
msgid "Glassblowers' Beacon facilities are ready for expansion. Help lay the foundation and clean up glass dust from the surrounding area."
msgstr "База «Маяк стеклодувов» готовится к расширению. Помоги заложить фундамент и убрать стеклянную пыль вокруг."

