#. fr: Première préparation du réseau
#. column 1: A phalanx of mini rovers facilitates power procurement. Retrieve mini rover battery packs, charge them at charging modules, then return the replenished packs to ensure the machines continue their useful trundling.
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
