#. column 1: A phalanx of mini rovers facilitates mobilization station construction. Retrieve mini rover battery packs, charge them at charging modules, then return the replenished packs to ensure the machines continue their useful trundling.
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
#. column 4: <switch $n1><case>Retrieve a battery pack.<case>Charge the battery pack.<case>Return the battery pack.</switch>
msgctxt "Fate:2038:0:0"
msgid "Mobilization Station Construction"
msgstr "Строительство станции мобилизации"

#. ja: ミニローダーのエネルギータンクを取り外し<br>エネルギースタンドにて充填して<br>ミニローダーにエネルギーを供給せよ
#. de: Für die Arbeiten an der Kühldrohnenstation wird Unterstützung benötigt.<br>Fülle die Energievorräte der Mechas an den entsprechenden Stellen auf.
#. fr: Récupérez les réservoirs d'énergie puis rechargez-les pour fournir de l'énergie aux ouvriers cosmiques.
#. column 0: Mobilization Station Construction
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
#. column 4: <switch $n1><case>Retrieve a battery pack.<case>Charge the battery pack.<case>Return the battery pack.</switch>
msgctxt "Fate:2038:0:1"
msgid "A phalanx of mini rovers facilitates mobilization station construction. Retrieve mini rover battery packs, charge them at charging modules, then return the replenished packs to ensure the machines continue their useful trundling."
msgstr "Для строительства станции мобилизации нужны мини-погрузчики. Доставай аккумуляторы, заряжай их на зарядных модулях и возвращай на место, чтобы машины продолжали работать."

#. ja: 共同施工作業の進捗度を確認中<br>ギャザラー、クラフター以外では<br>報酬を受け取れないため注意せよ
#. de: Wollen wir doch mal sehen, wie es um deinen Beitragsgrad steht.<br>  Aber spitz die Löffel: Nur Handwerker und Sammler können vergütet werden.
#. fr: Estimation de la progression des travaux en cours. Attention, seuls les récolteurs et les artisans seront récompensés pour leur con<shy>tri<shy>bu<shy>tion.
#. column 0: Mobilization Station Construction
#. column 1: A phalanx of mini rovers facilitates mobilization station construction. Retrieve mini rover battery packs, charge them at charging modules, then return the replenished packs to ensure the machines continue their useful trundling.
#. column 3: Contribution
#. column 4: <switch $n1><case>Retrieve a battery pack.<case>Charge the battery pack.<case>Return the battery pack.</switch>
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Fate:2038:0:2"
msgid "Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards."
msgstr "Проверяем вклад...<br>Награду получат только ремесленники и собиратели."

#. ja: 作業貢献度
#. de: Beitragsgrad
#. fr: Contribution
#. column 0: Mobilization Station Construction
