#. ja: 翠核の谷の遺跡を発掘するべく<br>堆積した土砂を掘り出し、回収して<br>集積場まで運搬せよ
#. de: Unterstütze die Ausgrabungsarbeiten im Tiefgrünen Echo, indem du Geröll abträgst, hochhievst und an der Abladefläche entlädst.
#. fr: Le chantier d'excavation des Échos d'Émeraude a commencé. Creusez pour dégager des sédiments et apportez-les jusqu'aux dépôts.
#. column 0: Emerald Echoes Excavation
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
#. column 4: <switch $n1><case>Dig up soil.<case>Collect debris.<case>Transport debris to the disposal site.</switch>
msgctxt "Fate:2066:0:1"
msgid "The time has come to excavate the ruins in Emerald Echoes. Dig up the accumulated soil, collect the resultant debris, then transport it to the disposal site."
msgstr "Пора расчистить руины в Изумрудном ущелье. Раскопай скопившийся грунт, собери обломки и отвези их на площадку для отходов."

#. ja: 共同施工作業の進捗度を確認中<br>ギャザラー、クラフター以外では<br>報酬を受け取れないため注意せよ
#. de: Wollen wir doch mal sehen, wie es um deinen Beitragsgrad steht.<br>Aber spitz die Löffel: Nur Handwerker und Sammler können vergütet werden.
#. fr: Estimation de la progression des travaux en cours. Attention, seuls les récolteurs et les artisans seront récompensés pour leur con<shy>tri<shy>bu<shy>tion.
#. column 0: Emerald Echoes Excavation
#. column 1: The time has come to excavate the ruins in Emerald Echoes. Dig up the accumulated soil, collect the resultant debris, then transport it to the disposal site.
#. column 3: Contribution
#. column 4: <switch $n1><case>Dig up soil.<case>Collect debris.<case>Transport debris to the disposal site.</switch>
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Fate:2066:0:2"
msgid "Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards."
msgstr "Проверяем ход работ...<br>Награду получат только ремесленники и собиратели."

