#. column 3: Contribution
#. column 4: <switch $n1><case>Obtain growth formula.<case>Disperse growth formula.</switch>
#. column 5: Growth Formula Cartridges
msgctxt "Fate:2088:0:1"
msgid "The time has come for us to see just how towering the Sprouting Towerling can become. Stock up on growth formula at the nearby tanks and spray the plants with the nourishing substance."
msgstr "Пора выяснить, какой высоты может достичь башенка-побег. Набери питательную смесь в ближайших резервуарах и опрыскай ею растения."

