#. de: Blütenturmling: Revitalisierung
#. fr: Restauration de la Pousse fleurie
#. column 1: The Sunning Towerling must be nurtured if it is to achieve its full size. Break off chunks of nearby indicolite and channel their energy into the tower's power conduits.
