#. column 1: We are ready to begin construction of the hydrofication station. Retrieve parts from a supply crate, assemble them at a fabrication station, then perform necessary upgrades.
#. column 3: Contribution
#. column 4: <switch $n1><case>Retrieve parts.<case>Assemble parts.<case>Perform upgrades.</switch>
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
