#. de: Keimturmling: Revitalisierung
#. fr: Restauration de la Pousse épanouie
#. column 1: The time has come for us to see just how towering the Sprouting Towerling can become. Stock up on growth formula at the nearby tanks and spray the plants with the nourishing substance.
