#. de: Wurzelturmling: Revitalisierung
#. fr: Restauration de la Pousse vivace
#. column 1: The powersuits will help us get the Rooting Towerling flourishing in no time. Drill off chunks of indicolite and channel their energy into the towerling's power conduits.
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
