msgstr "Протоколы активации бабушки Лорел"

#. ja: 「フォーミュラタンク」にて入手できる<br>グロースフォーミュラを使用し、<br>グランマ・ローレルの機能を復旧させよ
#. de: Besorge dir an der Nachfüllstation Wachstumsmittel und behandle damit Großmütterchen Lorbeer, um bei der Reaktivierung zu helfen.
#. fr: Récupérez des cartouches de formule de croissance à un réservoir de formule puis utilisez-les pour arroser les alentours du Laurier-Mère.
#. column 0: Grandma Laurel Activation Protocols
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
#. column 4: <switch $n1><case>Obtain growth formula.<case>Disperse growth formula.</switch>
#. column 5: Growth Formula Cartridges
msgctxt "Fate:2110:0:1"
msgid "We are ready to breathe life back into the enigmatic Grandma Laurel. Retrieve growth formula from the tanks and spray it freely around the area."
msgstr "Пора пробудить загадочную бабушку Лорел. Возьмите в резервуарах формулу роста и распылите её вокруг."

#. ja: 共同施工作業の進捗度を確認中<br>ギャザラー、クラフター以外では<br>報酬を受け取れないため注意せよ
#. de: Wollen wir doch mal sehen, wie es um deinen Beitragsgrad steht.<br>Aber spitz die Löffel: Nur Handwerker und Sammler können vergütet werden.
#. fr: Estimation de la progression des travaux en cours. Attention, seuls les récolteurs et les artisans seront récompensés pour leur con<shy>tri<shy>bu<shy>tion.
#. column 0: Grandma Laurel Activation Protocols
#. column 1: We are ready to breathe life back into the enigmatic Grandma Laurel. Retrieve growth formula from the tanks and spray it freely around the area.
#. column 3: Contribution
#. column 4: <switch $n1><case>Obtain growth formula.<case>Disperse growth formula.</switch>
#. column 5: Growth Formula Cartridges
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Fate:2110:0:2"
msgid "Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards."
msgstr "Проверяем ваш вклад...<br>Учтите: награды получают только ремесленники и собиратели."

